# Founder approval lock for the LEGEND release-control plane.
#
# This file does not change validation, publication, finalization, recovery,
# deployment, or runtime behavior. It only designates the Founder account as
# code owner for release-control surfaces. Enforcement must be paired with the
# repository ruleset option "Require review from Code Owners".
#
# The CODEOWNERS file itself is Founder-owned so the lock cannot be weakened
# through an ordinary change.
.github/CODEOWNERS @MYLEGND

# All GitHub Actions workflows are governance-sensitive because a new or
# modified workflow could otherwise introduce an alternate validation or
# deployment authority.
.github/workflows/** @MYLEGND

# Repository operating and deployment contracts.
AGENTS.md @MYLEGND
DEPLOYMENT.md @MYLEGND

# Canonical release/deployment/validation authorities and their regression
# tests. These patterns also cover future files in the same authority families.
scripts/release-* @MYLEGND
scripts/deploy-* @MYLEGND
scripts/validation-* @MYLEGND
scripts/approved-release-baseline.py @MYLEGND
scripts/wake-release-lifecycle.py @MYLEGND
scripts/test-release-* @MYLEGND
scripts/test-validation-resume.py @MYLEGND

# Retired alternate deployment paths remain Founder-owned if anyone attempts
# to recreate them.
deploy-portal.sh @MYLEGND
AgentPortal/deploy-* @MYLEGND
.claude/settings.local.json @MYLEGND
